OL,3,GNEWSA'I had cancer as a child, now I'm
OL,4,Aa beauty pageant queen'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Nicole Anderson was a child her
OL,7,Fparents were told she had only a 50%
OL,8,Fchance of surviving surgery.
OL,10,FShe went through a series of operations
OL,11,Fand chemotherapy as a baby, after
OL,12,Fcancerous tumours were found on her
OL,13,Fkidneys.
OL,15,FAnd she had to have further treatment
OL,16,Ffor congenital hip dysplasia, when it
OL,17,Fwas discovered she had been born
OL,18,Fwithout a right hip socket.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
